\"input_tokens\":4,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":575,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":746,\"output_tokens\":172,\"output_tokens_details\":{\"thinking_tokens\":46}} }\n\nevent: message_stop\ndata: {\"type\":\"message_stop\"          }\n\n"
